# Opus codec module

config OPUS
	bool "Opus audio codec library"
	help
	  Build the Opus codec from the xiph/opus submodule (lib/opus).
	  Fixed-point only: measured on a 128 MHz Cortex-M33, the float
	  build cannot reach real time even at complexity 0 (~31 ms per
	  20 ms stereo frame), while the fixed-point build runs at
	  ~4.7 ms per frame.
